excerpt:
bhagavānātreyaḥ // Car_1,1.2 
 [{Āyurvedadīpikā} 
 nanu kathamagniveśaḥ sakalapadārthāśeṣaviśeṣajñānavyākhyeyam āyurveda

stanmunervacaḥ // Car_1,1.31 
 [{Āyurvedadīpikā} 
 athetyādinā bharadvājaśiṣyasyātreyasya punarvasvaparanāmno 'gniveśādi

iṃśo'dhyāyaḥ // Car_1,26.114 
 [{Āyurvedadīpikā} 
 saṃgrahe dravyasaṃkhyā rasāśrayā iti bhedaścaiṣām ityādinā rasasaṃkhy

padravaṃ ceti // Car_6,1.4.7 
 [{Āyurvedadīpikā} 
 brahmasuvarcalāprabhṛtayo yathoktalakṣaṇā divyauṣadhayo nātiprasiddhā
